# Desktop Version

- Keep `desktop/` self-contained: run with `run.bat`, build with `build.bat`.
- Do not add dependencies on `../server`. Desktop must run without the `server` package.
- UI lives in `desktop/static/`; backend in `desktop/main.py`; anti-ban logic in `desktop/antiban_core.py`.
- Update `desktop/tests/` when API or UI behavior changes.
- PyInstaller spec must reference files inside `desktop/` only.
